<title>USA: Terra Industries Q4 distribution loss rises.</title>
<headline>Terra Industries Q4 distribution loss rises.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY, Iowa 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Terra Industries Inc said Monday its distribution business had an operating loss of $26.7 million on revenues of $162.5 million in the fourth quarter, compared with a loss of $18.9 million on revenues of $158.4 million in the 1995 quarter.</p>
<p>Operating income for nitrogen products was $55.2 million in the fourth quarter on revenues of $163.9 million, compared with year-ago operating income of $63.0 million on revenues of $158.2 million.</p>
